The Editor tile
29a-sd-tcl-the-home-screen
Starts sed, the full-screen text and record editor; it asks which file and record. It runs the command exactly as the person would have typed it, so it adds no access.
Turned off, the tile is missing from this account's home screen and its menu entry cannot be chosen. The person can still type sed at a prompt they have: this setting only changes the home screen.
